<p>
<strong>Billy.sh</strong> is a terminal-based AI coding assistant that runs entirely on your machine
using <a href="https://ollama.com">Ollama</a>. No API keys, no subscription, no data leaving your computer.
</p>
<p>
Built in Go with the <a href="https://github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea">Bubble Tea</a> TUI framework.
Fully offline. One-time purchase for Pro features, or free forever with the free tier.
</p>
